  "description": "There were always geniuses ahead of me. A wall I could never overcome no matter how hard I tried: Mun Jung-Min. He was the reason for all my defeats in school and the name I hated the most. But strangely enough, now that I’ve become a professional basketball player, I find myself thinking of him. Amid memories filled with jealousy and anger, perhaps I’m actually hoping to meet him again.\n\nThe story of a man who has endured by hating a genius.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)\n\n*Note: The fourteen and final story in the Sachungi: Neoreul Saenggakaneun Bom (사춘기: 너를 생각하는 봄) Collection.*",
